- Prevent duplicate reversals.
- Preserve inventory arithmetic.
- Make reconciliation account for the adjustment.
- Ensure a previously reversed purchase cannot be corrected as if it were active.
- Document how the effective stock contribution is calculated.

If the existing schema cannot safely support these properties, identify the minimum essential schema extension and migration rather than silently deleting history.

Preserve the existing eight-worksheet architecture.

